meta {
  name: 03 - Inventory Transfer Create (QC Transfer)
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

post {
  url: {{sap_base_url}}/api/inventory_transfer/create
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{sap_token}}
}

headers {
  Host: localhost
  Content-Type: application/json
  Accept: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "docDate": "2026-10-16",
    "remarks": "QC OK Transfer #45: 80 pcs TSPT10188XA-INJ from FFI to KRFG",
    "lines": [
      {
        "itemCode": "TSPT10188XA-INJ",
        "quantity": 80.0,
        "fromWarehouse": "FFI",
        "toWarehouse": "KRFG"
      }
    ]
  }
}

docs {
  # Inventory Transfer (QC Inspection Pass/Fail Split)
  
  Service Pengirim: `App\Services\QcTransferService`
  Trigger: Dijalankan ketika personil QC melakukan verifikasi box pada modul inspeksi (single box atau batch summary).
  
  Warehouse Routing:
  - **KBN**: 
    - OK Qty tidak ditransfer (tetap di warehouse asal).
    - Reject (NG) Qty ditransfer ke gudang `RJCT`.
  - **Karawang**:
    - OK Qty ditransfer ke `KRFG`.
    - Reject (NG) Qty ditransfer ke `KRRJCT`.
  
  Log & Audit: Tabel `qc_transfer_logs` dan `api_logs`.
}
